ar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T01:47:51-08:00","id":1026403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1026155-possible-future-kickstarter?p=1026302#post1026302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I'd back the hell out of that kickstarter, from my view it looks like we'll need to wait until Hunter and Changeling 2e are released. I'm also dubious we're going to get anything from Geist 2e until Changeling's out the door, which could be for quite a while.</div> </div> </div> </div>It looks like Geist is going to be coming out before Hunter, so this should be the kickstarter after the Changeling one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T05:10:35-08:00","id":1026455,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1026155-possible-future-kickstarter?p=1026403#post1026403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It looks like Geist is going to be coming out before Hunter, so this should be the kickstarter after the Changeling one.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am hoping that is the case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T11:03:24-08:00","id":1026615,"title":"","content":"While I'd fund this, I'd still like them to kickstart a CoD version of Wraith...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1630-jacob","name":"Jacob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1630_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T12:41:09-08:00","id":1027804,"title":"","content":"As noted in the Changeling kickstarter thread, it's a little dangerous to make stretch goals for a core rulebook, and here's why:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1025905-changeling-kickstarter?p=1027436#post1027436\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The important thing is that as little of the stretch goals as possible needs to go into core, so as to delay it ideally not at all. It hurts me that it's the case, but most RPG companies have learned that lesson the hard way.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, to avoid delaying the core, what kinds of things would you guys want in supplements of the game? Stuff that you'd like to be in the core, but the game could probably go out without?<br /> <br /> For me, if the core game doesn't include them (and even if it did), I'd like a supplement with sample Krewes and their ideologies. We only really got one with Geist 1e, via the premade characters, and it was hard to work a new one without more examples. The rules were fine and all, but overall...it was confusing for me.<br /> <br /> Also more Keys and Haunts, because options are fun. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T12:54:34-08:00","id":1027810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1026155-possible-future-kickstarter?p=1027804#post1027804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As noted in the Changeling kickstarter thread, it's a little dangerous to make stretch goals for a core rulebook, and here's why:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> So, to avoid delaying the core, what kinds of things would you guys want in supplements of the game? Stuff that you'd like to be in the core, but the game could probably go out without?<br /> <br /> For me, if the core game doesn't include them (and even if it did), I'd like a supplement with sample Krewes and their ideologies. We only really got one with Geist 1e, via the premade characters, and it was hard to work a new one without more examples. The rules were fine and all, but overall...it was confusing for me.<br /> <br /> Also more Keys and Haunts, because options are fun. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>More Dead Dominions in the Underworld, as well as its flora, fauna, and phenomena. How the more cognizant ghosts interact with the rest of the world. Other oddities that are ghost-proximate (like creatures that interact with them, ghost houses - as in the house dwells in Ghost!Twilight but not in the real world, etc.).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T12:57:41-08:00","id":1027813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1026155-possible-future-kickstarter?p=1027804#post1027804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As noted in the Changeling kickstarter thread, it's a little dangerous to make stretch goals for a core rulebook, and here's why:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> So, to avoid delaying the core, what kinds of things would you guys want in supplements of the game? Stuff that you'd like to be in the core, but the game could probably go out without?<br /> <br /> For me, if the core game doesn't include them (and even if it did), I'd like a supplement with sample Krewes and their ideologies. We only really got one with Geist 1e, via the premade characters, and it was hard to work a new one without more examples. The rules were fine and all, but overall...it was confusing for me.<br /> <br /> Also more Keys and Haunts, because options are fun. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Not only sample Krewes but sample Geists in general; I'd love some guidance on creating these weird dead bastards. Other than that, I'm a sucker for more prebuilt settings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T15:19:36-08:00","id":1027867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taidragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1026155-possible-future-kickstarter?p=1027804#post1027804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As noted in the Changeling kickstarter thread, it's a little dangerous to make stretch goals for a core rulebook, and here's why:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> So, to avoid delaying the core, what kinds of things would you guys want in supplements of the game? Stuff that you'd like to be in the core, but the game could probably go out without?<br /> <br /> For me, if the core game doesn't include them (and even if it did), I'd like a supplement with sample Krewes and their ideologies. We only really got one with Geist 1e, via the premade characters, and it was hard to work a new one without more examples. The rules were fine and all, but overall...it was confusing for me.<br /> <br /> Also more Keys and Haunts, because options are fun. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><ul><li>Coverage for mortal Mediums</li> <li>Playable ghost rules (i.e. mini-Wraith)</li> <li>A Night Horrors supplement specifically tied into the Underworld, Sin-Eaters and Geister</li> <li>Crossover stuff (although that will probably be in the Crossover Chronicle)</li> <li>An additional Dark Era and/or an update to the existing Geist Dark Eras</li> <li>More Dead Dominions, Keys and Haunts</li> <li>Maybe a sort of Danse Macabre-style hack compilation?</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T15:45:02-08:00","id":1027878,"title":"","content":"Oh, I would love crossover stuff (Mummy and Vampire especially!), and more Dark Eras would be lovely. And we never did get a Hunter group focused on ghosts or the Bound!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T16:48:54-08:00","id":1027921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1026155-possible-future-kickstarter?p=1027878#post1027878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, I would love crossover stuff (Mummy and Vampire especially!), and more Dark Eras would be lovely. And we never did get a Hunter group focused on ghosts or the Bound!</div> </div> </div> </div>For Hunter groups, I'd obviously expect a Ghostbuster-type technological/parapsychological ghost-hunters (to contrast with the Sin-Eaters' &quot;magic made of trash and booze&quot; methodology), and maybe a corporation with interest in the Underworld (maybe a DOOM &quot;free energy from Hell&quot; deal, maybe some sort of weird pharmaceuticals, maybe death god-fuelled supersoldiers, maybe all the above).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T17:49:23-08:00","id":1027947,"title":"","content":"A minor splat would be interesting for Sin Eaters; perhaps people who experienced <i>near</i> death scenarios but not actual death, but they had a Geist who was ready to offer the bargain. Since the bargain was not taken, they aren't Sin Eaters, but they've gotten a foot in the door, so to speak...and a Geist who is stuck to them, trying to get them to become a proper Sin Eater.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T20:54:22-08:00","id":1028016,"title":"","content":"According to the spoiler thread for Geist, there is already a minor/demi-splat coming with Geist 2e.<br /> <br /> Things thrown up there to be left for supplements as a possibility that were mentioned in there were the return of Abmortals, the scenarios of Hive-Bargained Sin-Eaters and Bloody Mary/Beetlejuice type entity antagonists (Dangerous entities that are anchored to their own names and are summoned when their name is uttered)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T03:53:07-08:00","id":1028097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Runcible</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1026155-possible-future-kickstarter?p=1028016#post1028016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bloody Mary/Beetlejuice type entity antagonists(Dangerous entities that are anchored to their own names and are summoned when their name is uttered)</div> </div> </div> </div>All that requires is for some ghosts, saying their name three times in the right situation (like in front of a mirror at midnight) to be enough to create the anchor condition for them as per the summoning rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}